---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Sheet from "../components/Sheet.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---

<Base title="About - Varun Malhotra">
  <Sheet rail={false}>
    <h1
      class="u-display"
      style="margin-top: var(--space-page); font-size: var(--text-h2); color: var(--color-ink);"
    >
      About
    </h1>

    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-block); font-size: var(--text-lede); line-height: var(--text-lede--line-height); color: var(--color-ink);">
      <p>
        The through-line has been the same question in different clothes: how do you know the
        model is right. At Samsung it was image restoration you could judge by eye. At Michelin it
        is a natural-language interface to a pricing warehouse, where the answer looks equally
        plausible whether or not it is correct, and eyeballing it stops working.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-para);">
        That is why most of what I build now is evaluation and guardrails rather than models.
        Benchmarks that exist before the system does, read-only enforcement that holds at every
        layer, gates that stop the agent when it is uncertain instead of letting it guess
        confidently.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-para);">
        I am in {profile.location}, and I am looking for work where the system has to hold up
        under real users rather than a demo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" style="margin-top: var(--space-section);" />

    <h2
      class="u-label"
      style="margin-top: var(--space-section); font-size: var(--text-caption); color: var(--color-ink-muted);"
    >
      Positions
    </h2>
    <div>
      {
        profile.roles.map((r, i) => (
          <div style={`display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding-block: var(--space-note); ${i > 0 ? "border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);" : ""}`}>
            <span class="fig" style="font-size: var(--text-note); color: var(--color-ink-muted); white-space: nowrap;">
              {r.dates}
            </span>
            <span style="text-align: right;">
              <span style="font-family: var(--font-text); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text-body); color: var(--color-ink);">
                {r.title}
              </span>
              {r.current && <span style="color: var(--color-accent);"> ●</span>}
              <br />
              <span style="font-size: var(--text-note); color: var(--color-ink-muted);">{r.company}</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" style="margin-top: var(--space-section);" />

    <h2
      class="u-label"
      style="margin-top: var(--space-section); font-size: var(--text-caption); color: var(--color-ink-muted);"
    >
      Education
    </h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding-block: var(--space-note);">
      <span class="fig" style="font-size: var(--text-note); color: var(--color-ink-muted); white-space: nowrap;">
        {profile.education.dates}
      </span>
      <span style="text-align: right;">
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-text); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text-body); color: var(--color-ink);">
          {profile.education.school}
        </span>
        <br />
        <span style="font-size: var(--text-note); color: var(--color-ink-muted);">
          {profile.education.degree}, GPA {profile.education.gpa}
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" style="margin-top: var(--space-section);" />

    <h2
      class="u-label"
      style="margin-top: var(--space-section); font-size: var(--text-caption); color: var(--color-ink-muted);"
    >
      Skills
    </h2>
    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-tight);">
      {
        profile.skills.map((g) => (
          <p style="margin-top: var(--space-tight); font-size: var(--text-note); line-height: 1.8;">
            <span class="u-label" style="color: var(--color-ink-muted);">{g.group}:</span>{" "}
            {g.items.map((s, i) => (
              <Fragment>
                {i > 0 && <span style="color: var(--color-rule);"> ❘ </span>}
                <span style="color: var(--color-ink);">{s}</span>
              </Fragment>
            ))}
          </p>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" style="margin-top: var(--space-section);" />

    <h2
      class="u-label"
      style="margin-top: var(--space-section); font-size: var(--text-caption); color: var(--color-ink-muted);"
    >
      Contact
    </h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-tight); font-size: var(--text-body);">
      <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`} style="text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-rule);">{profile.email}</a><br />
      <a href={profile.linkedin} style="text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-rule);">{profile.linkedin.replace("https://www.", "")}</a><br />
      <a href={profile.github} style="text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--color-rule);">{profile.github.replace("https://", "")}</a><br />
      <span style="color: var(--color-ink-muted);">{profile.location}</span>
    </p>
  </Sheet>
</Base>
